+| `dr-bortecen.png` | `https://s33929.pcdn.co/wp-content/uploads/sites/411/2021/06/DrKeremBortecen_6.jpg` | Lossless local source captured at the published 800 × 964 dimensions |
+| `dr-bortecen.webp` | Local WebP derivative of `dr-bortecen.png`, quality 82 | Responsive page image |
+| `office.png` | `https://s33929.pcdn.co/wp-content/uploads/sites/411/2021/06/Office1-1-853x1000.jpeg` | Archived published source; not used in the final page |
+| `office.webp` | Local WebP derivative of `office.png`, quality 78 | Optimized alternate; not used in the final page |
+| `lora-latin.woff2` | Google Fonts Lora v37; Lora is one of the type families published by the current site | Self-hosted display type |
+| `montserrat-latin.woff2` | Google Fonts Montserrat v31; Montserrat is one of the type families published by the current site | Self-hosted interface type |
+
+The Canva direction board uses generated flat layout elements and typography only; it contains no generated photo or business claim.
