+# Asset provenance
+
+All brand and photographic source assets were retrieved from pages published by the audited website on 2026-09-01. No stock, generated, or competitor imagery was added.
+
+| Local asset | Published source | Use |
+|---|---|---|
+| `logo.jpg` | `https://s33929.pcdn.co/wp-content/uploads/sites/411/2021/05/Screenshot-30x.jpg` | Header wordmark |
+| `dr-bortecen.png` | `https://s33929.pcdn.co/wp-content/uploads/sites/411/2021/06/DrKeremBortecen_6.jpg` | Lossless local source captured at the published 800 × 964 dimensions |
