+        </li>
+        <li>
+          <article class="review-card"><div aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I've had a fantastic experience with Dr. Bortecen and SoHo Men's Health. Not only have I had great results, but Dr. Bortecen is an extremely kind, patient, and thorough doctor who will consistently go the extra mile for his patients. I highly recommend the clinic, it is a true gem in NYC!”</blockquote><p>P.C. <span>Google</span></p></article>
