+        </li>
+        <li>
+          <article class="review-card"><div aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Dr. Bortecen is an excellent doctor. He is measured and very practical. I particularly like how he thorough he is in determining an appropriate course of action. On a personal level, he is a kind individual with a great sense of humor - actually look forward to our sessions.”</blockquote><p>R.D. <span>Google</span></p></article>
+        </li>
+        <li>
+          <article class="review-card"><div aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“It has been such a relief to work with Dr. Bortecen since my first visit. He is highly professional and especially caring, he follows up personally to ensure that any health issue or concern has been addressed and encourages continuous improvement. I can not recommend this doctor enough to anyone with any health concern or question.”</blockquote><p>O.S. <span>Google</span></p></article>
+        </li>
